==Event Information==
<tabber>
Pre-Announcement=
We are pleased to announce a very special offline celebration event for fans of The Battle Cats!<br>
Date: November 1st, 2025<br>
Place: California, USA

More details about the event and how YOU can apply for an invitation will be revealed in mid-September.<br>
Keep an eye out for further information on the official social media channels of The Battle Cats as well as in-app notices to learn more then!
|-|
Announcement=<p></p>
We are proud to announce The Battle Cats 11th Anniversary Nyawards Ceremony, a special event recognizing the contributions of five different categories of Battle Cats over their eleven year campaign to conquer time and space!<br>
click and jump to the link below to check event details and apply for the invitation!

https://battlecats.club/en/special/nyawardscelebration_2025/
|-|
Voting Periods=<p></p>
Celebrate the 11 Years of The Battle Cats by voting in the Nyawards campaign!

Help us in recognizing the nom... ahem... nya-minees for (nine-)lifetime achievements in one of several different cat-egories!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Cast your votes between September 19 and October 22, 2025!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Introducing The Battle Cats Nyaward Categories...'''}}<br>
Each week, vote for your favorite Cat hero among five nominees in a new category by visiting the Cat Base and tapping the Nyawards button to access the in-app voting page!

Your vote will help determine the:<br>
① Best Defender - Voting from 9/19 (11:00AM) - 10/22<br>
② Best Attacker - Voting from 9/24 (11:00AM) - 10/22<br>
③ Best Debuffer - Voting from 9/29 (11:00AM) - 10/22<br>
④ Best True Form - Voting from 10/4 (11:00AM) - 10/22

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special Achievement Nyaward'''}}<br>
Players who purchase a special Rare Ticket pack on sale from October 10th at 11:00AM will be able to vote for the Special Achievement Nyaward! These Special Achievement Nyaward voters will also be entered in a sweepstakes where eleven lucky winners will be randomly chosen to receive the Uber Rare Cat they voted for in that category!

Your voice matters, so don't forget to vote for your favorite Cat among the nominees!<br>
Results will be announced in a special ceremony to be held on November 1st, 2025!
|-|
Special Achievement=<p></p>
Celebrate the 11 Years of The Battle Cats by voting in the Nyawards campaign!

Help us in recognizing the nom... ahem... nya-minees for (nine-)lifetime achievements in one of several different cat-egories!

Voting in the final category has begun: the Special Achievement Nyaward!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Cast your votes between October 10 and October 22, 2025!'''}}

Tap the Special Achievement Nyawards tab at top left of the Cat Base and purchase the limited Rare Ticket pack underneath the nominated Cat Hero of your choice to vote for the Special Achievement Nyaward!<br>
Voters for the Special Achievement Nyaward will not only get 3 Rare Tickets at a great price, but also be entered in a sweepstakes where eleven lucky winners will be randomly chosen to receive the Uber Rare Cat they voted for in the category!

※If you don't see The Battle Cats Special Achievement Nyaward sale tab at top right of the Cat Base menu, please update your The Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Introducing The Battle Cats Nyaward Categories...'''}}<br>
Also, don't forget to vote for your favorite Cat heroes from among 20 nominees in four categories by visiting the Cat Base and tapping the Nyawards button to access the in-app voting page! Voting is open until October 22nd, so don't miss out on your chance to support the heroes who have helped most along your Battle Cats journey!

Your vote will help determine the:<br>
① Best Defender - Voting from 9/19 (11:00AM) - 10/22<br>
② Best Attacker - Voting from 9/24 (11:00AM) - 10/22<br>
③ Best Debuffer - Voting from 9/29 (11:00AM) - 10/22<br>
④ Best True Form - Voting from 10/4 (11:00AM) - 10/22

※If you don't see The Battle Cats Nyawards tab at top right of the Cat Base menu, please update your The Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.

Your voice matters, so don't forget to vote for your favorite Cat among the nominees!<br>
Results will be announced in a special ceremony to be held on November 1st, 2025!
|-|
Voting Closed=<p></p>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''The voting is now CLOSED for all categories in The Battle Cats Nyawards!'''}}

A big thanks from the Cats and everyone else at PONOS for all your votes and support for our nominees!<br>
We've collected all your votes in both the Nyaward categories and for the Special Achievement Nyaward, and are now counting the totals to determine the winners!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Keep an eye out for the online announcement of the winners at the beginning of November following our special Nyawards Ceremony live event on November 1st!'''}}

● Review the Nominees in each Nyaward Category!<br>
The voting may be finished for the Nyawards, but you can still visit the Nyawards event page to learn more information about the nominated Cats in each category.<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''If you're not sure how to get the most out of your Battle Cats army, the information on each nominee Cat will surely help you overcome the challenges found in each campaign of The Battle Cats!'''}}

Which lucky Cats will walk away with a Nyaward in paw at the end of the campaign? Stay tuned to find out!
|-|
Results=<p></p>
The votes have been counted, and we have our winners of The Battle Cats 11th Anniversary Nyawards campaign!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Introducing The Battle Cats Nyaward Categories...'''}}<br>
Winner of the Best Defender Nyaward: Crazed Tank Cat<br>
Winner of the Best Attacker Nyaward: Bahamut Cat<br>
Winner of the Best Debuffer Nyaward: Surfer Cat<br>
Winner of the Best True Form Nyaward: Rocker Cat<br>
Winner of the Special Achievement Nyaward: Kasli the Bane

To honor the Nyaward winners and thank everyone who voted, we are giving all players a bonus gift of one Rare Ticket, available to collect at the Cat Base until November 10th, 2025 at 10:59AM. Don't forget to pick up your gift!

{{Color|#4285F4|'''Visit The Battle Cats Official channel on YouTube to watch the stirring acceptance speeches from the winner of each category!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Winners of the Special Achievement Nyaward sweepstakes to receive prizes on 11/2!'''}}<br>
On 11/3, we will announce the eleven lucky winners randomly chosen to receive the Uber Rare Cat they voted for by purchasing the Special Achievement Nyaward pack!

Visit the Mailbox from the title menu of The Battle Cats app from 11/2 at 4:00PM to see if you've won an Uber Rare hero!<br>
If you were one of the lucky chosen players, claim and activate your prize by tapping the button next to the character in your Mailbox list!

※Prizes must be claimed from the Mailbox within 30 days of being delivered, or your reward will become invalid.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Review the Nominees in each Nyaward Category!'''}}<br>
The voting may be finished for the Nyawards, but you can still visit the Nyawards event page to learn more information about the nominated Cats in each category.
If you're not sure how to get the most out of your Battle Cats army, the information on each nominee Cat will surely help you overcome the challenges found in each campaign of The Battle Cats!
